<title>NETHERLANDS: DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of June 9.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Dutch economic indicators week of June 9.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT---date--indicator-----------------period---previous</p>
<p>  0730   9/6  producer price index	April    +2.2 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>  0730  12/6  manufacturing production  April    +5.1 pct yr/yr</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
